# CR 601.2h: a colourless hybrid shard ({C/W}) paid on its coloured side --
# ChoosePayColorlessHybrid true, manapay.go -- spends a white mana from the
# pool rather than a colourless one.
# Main phase of turn 1, so the payment is made at a priority (L2 S19); the
# lands are tapped there, since a pool loaded by setup.state empties as the
# steps pass (CR 500.4).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 1 W
queue paycolorlesshybrid true
paymanacost human C/W
